UPDATE - I'm finally have found the cause why I can't use Very Poor avatars for very long time. Private DNS settings is the real reason that makes me suffering far too long!

According to Pi-maker (VRC Team) at Discord has give me a hint something that blocks analytics to VRC. Then, I decided to find out in Connection settings and found the cause. Now, Private DNS has been disabled completely and I can use any Very Poor avatars (second pic) without problem anymore in S22 Ultra! 🎉🙌🏼

